"Check the LM Studio server address in Settings." = "请在设置中检查 LM Studio 服务器地址。";
"Download Anima models on a supported device before generating images." = "请先在受支持的设备上下载 Anima 模型，再生成图像。";
"The provider returned an invalid anime prompt. Your original prompt was kept." = "提供商返回了无效的动漫提示词。原始提示词已保留。";
"The suggestion is in English for Anima. Check names, appearance and clothing before applying it. Your original prompt stays unchanged until you choose Use prompt." = "建议提示词使用适合 Anima 的英语。请检查姓名、外观和服装。选择使用提示词前，原文不会改变。";
"Your prompt changed while the suggestion was open. Request a new suggestion to keep your latest edits." = "检查建议期间提示词发生了更改。请重新获取建议以保留最新编辑。";
"Invalid structured text request" = "结构化文本请求无效";
"1. Select a provider and language model in Settings. For local GGUF, download and select a language model separately from the Anima image model." = "1. 在设置中选择提供商和语言模型。使用本地 GGUF 时，需要下载并选择独立的语言模型，它与 Anima 图像模型不同。";
"2. Describe the image in your language. Enhance prompt keeps your subject, names, appearance, outfit and pose while adding compatible lighting, composition and background details." = "2. 用你熟悉的语言描述图像。细化提示词会保留主体、姓名、外观、服装和姿势，并补充合适的光线、构图和背景。";
"3. Random character proposes either an existing anime character with their series, or a new original character. This creates a prompt, not an image." = "3. 随机角色可推荐带作品名称的已有动漫角色，或全新原创角色。这一步只创建提示词，不生成图像。";
"4. Review and edit the English suggestion. Use prompt replaces the editor only when you choose it; Use and generate also starts Anima. Cancel keeps your original text." = "4. 检查并编辑英文建议。选择使用提示词才会替换编辑器内容；使用并生成还会立即启动 Anima。取消可保留原文。";
"5. Check character details before generating. Keep the app in the foreground while Anima works; loading and image generation can take several minutes. Stop is cooperative and may finish the current phase first." = "5. 生成前请检查角色细节。Anima 运行时请将应用保持在前台；加载和生成可能需要几分钟。停止可能需要等待当前阶段结束。";
"Invalid image generation settings" = "图像生成设置无效";
"Image settings" = "图像设置";
"More steps may improve detail, but generation takes longer. Anima Turbo can reach its best quality with fewer steps; more is not always sharper." = "增加步数可能改善细节，但会耗时更久。Anima Turbo 可能在较少步数时达到最佳质量，并非步数越多就越清晰。";
"Larger images have more pixels and need more time and RAM. Start with 512 × 512; a larger size may not fit your device's available memory." = "大图像的像素更多，需要更多时间和内存。建议从 512 × 512 开始；较大的尺寸可能超出设备的可用内存。";
